# iHRMS Monitor Build & Packaging Instructions

1. Install Inno Setup 6 (https://jrsoftware.org/isdl.php)
2. Build Standalone PyInstaller Bundle (No UPX, Full Dependencies):
   python -m PyInstaller --noconfirm --clean "iHRMS Monitor.spec"

3. Compile Inno Setup Installer:
   "%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\Inno Setup 6\ISCC.exe" "IHRMS Monitor.iss"
   (or "C:\Program Files (x86)\Inno Setup 6\ISCC.exe" "IHRMS Monitor.iss")

4. Generated Installer:
   installer\iHRMS-Monitor-Installer.exe
   dist\installer\iHRMSMonitorSetup.exe